  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal multiprofile models with scgpt and imagenet_vit_l achieve ~0.52 accuracy. This experiment tests replacing RNA encoder with pca_n2000 and image encoder with resnet50 while maintaining transformer aggregation and weighted fusion. It clarifies if these encoder choices improve performance. Expected cost is higher than config_027 (2.86 GPU hours) due to resnet50 and transformer, but potential accuracy gains justify the cost."
